    "updated_at": "2019-12-21T15:12:48Z",
    "body": "Executing `export VISUAL=\"\"` and then `starship configure` causes the same error on Linux -\r\n\r\n```shell script\r\nthread 'main' panicked at 'failed to open file: Os { code: 2, kind: NotFound, message: \"No such file or directory\" }', src/libcore/result.rs:1165:5\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe should check if `VISUAL` or `EDITOR` is empty and use the fallback where necessary.",
